\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4185470/005-8b56b3379a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4185470/005-8b56b3379a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4185470/006-2966137838.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4185470/006-2966137838.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"638\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这还是我第一次\n在这样的直播中进行实机试玩\n总觉得有点紧张（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n当然\n会蹦出来什么样的\n宝可梦也完全预测不到（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n如果只出现芭瓢虫的话……\n那可就糟了……\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n不过\n小笃儿能出现真是太好了！\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4185470/007-1457342a36.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4185470/007-1457342a36.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"716\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后\n猫鼬少也出现了，太好了！\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4185470/008-5e3fdf4b73.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4185470/008-5e3fdf4b73.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"438\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这次试玩时\n虽然没有出现\n但根据草丛所在的位置\n有时会出现的强颚鸡母虫！\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4185470/009-ea60977310.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4185470/009-ea60977310.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"490\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n还有新的对战！\n「皇家对战」\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4185470/010-4fabe4c106